  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Instit. Netw. for Design and Manufact. Educ. and Train.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the capacity of partner institutions in Ethiopia to improve the quality of engineering education and TVET. It aligns with the national development plans and priorities of Ethiopia and focus on design and manufacturing engineering and outreach activities to TVET. This implies job capacity building ( PhD and MSc ptrogrammes), outreach activities to industry and job-creation (self-employability) with women empowerment (50%) through problem-based approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
